# Naming

Do not name the hardware vendor or the original calculator model in
source, comments, docs, canvases, filenames, commit messages, or chat.
Say **the hardware**, **the unit**, **the manual**, or **Shevon**.

The local behavior spec is `manual.pdf` (gitignored). Golden tests are
`src/manual.golden.test.ts`. Do not reconstruct a vendor PDF filename
or a commercial model string.
